    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n12266" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπο-βῐάζομαλ</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>force away, force back,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ ὑγρόν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>IA</u>
					714a19
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ κωλῦον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Pr.</u>
					903b5
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>GA</u>
				737b29
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Mete.</u>
				368b10
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PPetr.</u>
				3p.39
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii B.C.)</span>:—
				Pass.
			, <i>to be forced away</i> or <i>back,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Cyr.</u>
				4.2.24
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Mete.</u>
				364a29
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. εἰς ἐλάττω τόπον</span>
			<i>to be forced</i> into . ., ib.<i><span class="en">
				366b11
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>treat with uiolence,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινά</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plb.
					16.24.5
				</span></i>
			: abs., <i><span class="en">
				33.9.5
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>SIG</u>
				629.20
			</span></i> (Delph., <span class="entity">ii B. C.</span>), Wilcken <i><span class="en">
				<u>Chr.</u>
				11
			</span></i><i><span class="en">
				<u>A</u>
				30
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii B. C.)</span>: metaph., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατὰ τὰς λέξεων ὁμιλίας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Phld.
					<u>Oec.</u>
					p.59J.
				</span></i>
			
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> abs., <i>use force,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Cyr.</u>
				3.1.19
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Mete.</u>
				364b8
			</span></i>, al.: <i>force its way,</i> ib.<i><span class="en">
				351a6
			</span></i>:—
				Act.
			
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπο-βιάζω</span></b> , Sch.<i><span class="en">
				Theoc.
				6.18
			</span></i>.</div>
